<!DOCTYPE html>
<script type="application/json" id="cowork-artifact-meta">
{
  "name": "Pitch Lab (English)",
  "schemaVersion": 1,
  "description": "Design and audit a pitcher's arsenal end to end. (1) Turn spin axis / spin rate / spin efficiency / velocity into an MLB pitch-type verdict. (2) Set release height, arm slot, extension and rubber position, then throw it and get the arrival point, VAA and real-time playback with the seams drawn. (3) Compare against MLB averages and swept conditions. (4) Overlay the arsenal and check the tunnel at the 23.8 ft decision point (batter view, side, top, cross-section). (5) Brute-force the best pitch pair and location for a goal: strikeout, strike when behind, chase when behind, weak contact. (6) Work out where to point the arm to land a pitch on a chosen course. Measured values can be typed in or imported from a Rapsodo CSV; profiles save to .json.",
  "mcpTools": [],
  "mcpServerNames": []
}
</script>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Pitch Lab — from spin to pitch type, trajectory and location</title>
<style>
  :root{
    color-scheme:dark;
    --surface-0:#111110; --surface-1:#1a1a19; --surface-2:#232320; --surface-3:#2e2e2a;
    --line:#3a3a35; --text-primary:#ffffff; --text-secondary:#c3c2b7; --text-muted:#8f8e85;
