      '<b>horizontal approach angle (HAA)</b> and the <b>angle</b> the ball comes in on. '+
      'Standing on the arm-side edge against a same-handed batter sharpens the angle coming in from outside &mdash; crossfire.';
    h='<thead><tr><th>Rubber spot</th><th>Release side</th><th>Aim needed</th><th>HAA</th><th>VAA</th><th>Plate crossing</th><th>Flight</th></tr></thead><tbody>';
